        <key>construction</key>
        <string>Retain the entire genuine same-cut SC M body. Attach the purpose-coded native U0271 descending hook. Match both measured SC right-stem edges through the baseline, blending horizontally to the translated unchanged deep native hook below the joining band. No capital reduction, ordinary M alias, synthetic italic or reference outline.</string>
